        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "## Canonical User Intent (already disambiguated by LLM)\r\nIterate over each element in the list %item.GoalSteps% and for each element, call the goal or step named CheckStep\n## functions available starts ##\n{\"Description\":\"While, for, foreach, loops, repeat, go through a list and call a goal\",\"Methods\":[{\"Description\":\"Repeat a call to a function number of time. Great for pagination, where repeatCount is page count and startIndex is page number. startIndex starts at 0\",\"MethodName\":\"Repeat\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.Int32\",\"Name\":\"repeatCounter\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCall\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Int32\",\"Name\":\"startIndex\",\"DefaultValue\":0,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"Predefined variables are %list%, %item%, %position%, %listCount%, user can overwrite those using parameters, e.g. `- go through %products%, call goal ProcessProduct item=%product%`, parameter key is \\\"item\\\" and value is \\\"%product%\\\". cpuUsage is percentage of cpu cores available, 80% => 0.8\",\"MethodName\":\"RunLoop\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"variableToLoopThrough\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCall\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.LoopModule.Program+MultiThreaded\",\"Name\":\"multiThreaded\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.LoopModule.Program+LinqOptions\",\"Name\":\"linqOptions\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false}],\"SupportingObjects\":[{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCall\",\"Description\":\"Name of goal and parameters that is called, e.g. in condition, loops, run goal. Keep Name as user defines it with path\",\"TypeProperties\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Name\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary`2[System.String,System.Object]\",\"Name\":\"Parameters\",\"Description\":\"The named values handed to the goal being called, and only those: they are what the step writes for that call, e.g. `call goal Chat id=%chatId%` passes id. Each entry's name is written to the LEFT of the = and its value to the RIGHT, so `call goal SignIn next=\\\"/admin/Overview\\\"` is {\\\"next\\\": \\\"/admin/Overview\\\"}: the wrapping quotes are dropped, and the value is never the name written back as %next%. Empty whenever the step names the goal and nothing else, e.g. `on tool call, call ToolUsed`. A variable the step uses for its own work is not passed on just by being in the step\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.LoopModule.Program+MultiThreaded\",\"Name\":\"multiThreaded\",\"TypeProperties\":[{\"Type\":\"System.Int32\",\"Name\":\"ThreadCount\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Double\",\"Name\":\"CpuUsage\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"FailFast\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"GoalToCallBeforeItemIsProcessed\",\"Description\":\"(see PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"GoalToCallAfterItemIsProcessed\",\"Description\":\"(see PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.LoopModule.Program+LinqOptions\",\"Name\":\"linqOptions\",\"TypeProperties\":[{\"Type\":\"System.Int32\",\"Name\":\"Split\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"IsRequired\":false}]}\n## functions available ends ##\n## defined variables ##\nitem.GoalSteps (type:object), \n## defined variables ##"
            }
